start\-cli\-server\-bittorrent \- Manage BitTorrent sharing of stored software
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli server bittorrent\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage BitTorrent sharing of stored software
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
